{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau","id":1272040,"title":"Thundercats 2011 are PERFECT inspiration for Mau!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-30T14:04:27-08:00","id":1272040,"title":"Thundercats 2011 are PERFECT inspiration for Mau!","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Thundercats </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2011 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">seems PERFECT inspiration for </span></span></span><b>Monarchies of Mau</b><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">! </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:transparent\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span></span> It's fantasy about humanoid cats. It has Masterworks of old technologies! It has court intrigues! They are even other Animal Races in it's world! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( Beside maybe the rare guns and spaceships - this maybe too much for <b>Mau</b>. )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TM-je_ZzWlQ\" data-code=\"TM-je_ZzWlQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/TM-je_ZzWlQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-01-2018, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T14:12:27-08:00","id":1272042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau#post1272040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">snip</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, my (later) childhood returns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T15:14:56-08:00","id":1272051,"title":"","content":"Eh? I mean, sure, there are some strong similarities and it might be something to get some people in the mood... but perfect? Not really.<br /> <br /> It would be like saying someone should watch the LotR and Hobbit movies to get inspired for D&amp;D. There's plenty of stuff to get loosely inspired by, But playing a level 1 human ranger with the expectation you're going to be playing Aragorn is getting to disappoint you really, really fast, let alone playing a wizard and thinking you're going to be Gandalf.<br /> <br /> --------<br /> <br /> Also... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> maybe like, a thread of &quot;Share Cool ideas for Realms of Pugmire&quot; or something rather than a new thread every time something strikes you? Since it doesn't really seem like you feel like discussing this rather than just sharing.... it would probably be easier to have a general thread of share-the-thing-you-found.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T20:12:19-08:00","id":1272108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau?p=1272051#post1272051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> maybe like, a thread of &quot;Share Cool ideas for Realms of Pugmire&quot; or something rather than a new thread every time something strikes you? Since it doesn't really seem like you feel like discussing this rather than just sharing.... it would probably be easier to have a general thread of share-the-thing-you-found.</div> </div> </div> </div>To Hamster, I second this.<br /> <br /> To Arms, hoo boy this fight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T20:42:20-08:00","id":1272113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau?p=1272051#post1272051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would be like saying someone should watch the LotR and Hobbit movies to get inspired for D&amp;D. There's plenty of stuff to get loosely inspired by, But playing a level 1 human ranger with the expectation you're going to be playing Aragorn is getting to disappoint you really, really fast, let alone playing a wizard and thinking you're going to be Gandalf.</div> </div> </div> </div>Last time I checked my <b>Pugmire</b> corebook, in proposed Ready-To-Play Characters section is Princess Yosha Pug. So inexperienced royalty is very much in themes of <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> PCs. <i>Especially</i> in <b>Mau</b>, where you have at least 6 Great Houses and countless lesser ones in Shadow Block. <i>And </i>that for (real world) cats and dogs to have 6-8 children in a litter is not unheard of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-30-2018, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T21:23:37-08:00","id":1272117,"title":"","content":"My characters Callings assertion for this moment \u2013 take notice I use the hack shown in <b>Pugmire</b> that <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1264393-mau-pugmire-multiclassing?p=1264704#post1264704\">character can use Secrets from other Callings</a>.<br /> <br /> <i>Lion-O</i> \u2013 Champion, with powerful Sword of Omens Masterwork<br /> <i>Cheetara</i> \u2013 Wanderer, with one or two Secrets from Minister's list<br /> <i>Tygra</i> \u2013 Champion, with Whip of Invisibility Masterwork and small pistol Masterwork<br /> <i>WilyKat</i> and <i>WilyKit</i> - Footpads. <i>WilyKit</i> has also Magic Aptitude Secret, with <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1273318-mau-fan-oneiromancy-%E2%80%93-sleep-magic\">Sleep spell</a> she cast by playing instrument. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-13-2018, 12:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-30T23:32:35-08:00","id":1272132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau?p=1272113#post1272113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last time I checked my <b>Pugmire</b> corebook, in proposed Ready-To-Play Characters section is Princess Yosha Pug. So inexperienced royalty is very much in themes of <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> PCs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Great.. and Aragorn is an inexperienced noble too. The point is, you're not going to feel like you're playing Lion-O in Monarchies... refining his two Masterwork items (the Sword, Gauntlet/Armor of Omens) to replicate what they do in the show would, if we're being generous, take you to level 10 alone. Which isn't a very effective character.<br /> <br /> That's the problem. The baselines of what characters can do is radically different. How powerful you can hope to get is radically different. The kinds of challenges you're going to face, etc. etc.<br /> <br /> Can you pick from the Thundercats some basic character archetypes (that all existed before anyway) and group dynamics... but in the end you're not going to have a game that feels like a few episodes of Thundercats. It's going to feel like a game of Monarchies of Mau with an inexperienced noble warrior, his resentful brother that's not in line for the throne, his female bodyguard, etc.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-01T01:58:49-08:00","id":1272143,"title":"","content":"One big differance between Thundercats and <b>Mau</b> and <b>Pugmire</b> setting - is that Lizards in TV series are working like the Badgers in <b>Realms</b> universe - i.e. they are 'barbarians' of the world. Lizards in the <b>Realms</b> are much more 'exotic traders from desert', not so 'warfare clans' as they are in Thundercats.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-12T21:59:31-08:00","id":1274139,"title":"","content":"Rest of two Thundercats that join later team:<ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Panthro - (almost) general of Thundera, so Champion is logical.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Pumyra - ex-gladiator so Champion is in order here. </span></span></span></li> </ul><br /> Edit on Thunderkittens ideas:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1272040-thundercats-2011-are-perfect-inspiration-for-mau?p=1272117#post1272117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>WilyKat</i> and <i>WilyKit</i> - Footpads. <i>WilyKit</i> has also Magic Aptitude Secret, with <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1273318-mau-fan-oneiromancy-%E2%80%93-sleep-magic\">Sleep spell</a> she cast by playing instrument. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}